{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of <i>Hubert</i>, a loyal shepherd navigating the uncharted northern wilderness. In this atmospheric third-person adventure, guide a scattered flock of sheep across gorgeous nature, braving harsh weather, treacherous terrain, and hidden dangers. <i>Hubert</i>\u00a0blends immersive storytelling with a unique herding gameplay experience, all from the perspective of a devoted working dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tale of friendship, bravery, and barking at sheep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.poster.avif?t=1772993823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.webm?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.mp4?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DOG</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Hubert, a fluffy and overconfident dog with a nose for trouble. He sees the world through movement, scent, instinct, and curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You experience the journey entirely from Hubert\u2019s perspective, as a devoted working dog learning his place in a quiet world that slowly proves less predictable than it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.poster.avif?t=1772993823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.webm?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.mp4?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BOND</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hubert is not alone. By his side is Lily, a sharp-witted kid who just convinced the grumpiest farmer in the valley to give them a job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their relationship grows through shared routines, small moments, and quiet trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world around them changes, that bond is tested in subtle ways, shaping how Hubert sees the world and why he keeps going.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/ce6b15c9915897a3b74c91fd3a2bd33d.poster.avif?t=1772993823\" width=1024 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/ce6b15c9915897a3b74c91fd3a2bd33d.webm?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/ce6b15c9915897a3b74c91fd3a2bd33d.mp4?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HERD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission is to herd dozens of mildly chaotic sheep across pastures. Easy, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, not when the sheep have the attention span of a goldfish and the farmer has zero patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Herding With Heart (and Fur):</strong> Commander Hubert is leading a battalion of sheep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story Full of Barks and Blunders:</strong> Navigate farm life, forge unlikely friendships, and try to stay on the farmer\u2019s good side, or at least out of range of his angry voice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/721d939582583bc1ea6ee42e716b1ebf.poster.avif?t=1772993823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/721d939582583bc1ea6ee42e716b1ebf.webm?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/721d939582583bc1ea6ee42e716b1ebf.mp4?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WILD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the fence line, the land grows quieter and stranger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is something in the woods?</strong> Something is out there. It is not just a threat, but a call Hubert understands in ways he cannot fully explain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brush-Painted Charm:</strong> Explore a countryside that feels warm and inviting on the surface, yet hides moments of unease, mystery, and the occasional howling at the moon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/8e7233da2eb44ec1e4ef9c822a28738e.poster.avif?t=1772993823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/8e7233da2eb44ec1e4ef9c822a28738e.webm?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/8e7233da2eb44ec1e4ef9c822a28738e.mp4?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains mild mischief, stubborn sheep, and a dog who thinks he\u2019s the main character (He might be right.)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1772993823\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras_big/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1772993823 width=800 height=587 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/764930?t=1772993823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/2c09ca02106f83426d017c9dc7b50263ca51e645/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772993823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/bb99f13ae97d4b0ad0797e24c119abd62d705d1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772993823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/bb99f13ae97d4b0ad0797e24c119abd62d705d1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772993823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3676940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of <i>Hubert</i>, a loyal shepherd navigating the uncharted northern wilderness. In this atmospheric third-person adventure, guide a scattered flock of sheep across gorgeous nature, braving harsh weather, treacherous terrain, and hidden dangers. <i>Hubert</i>\u00a0blends immersive storytelling with a unique herding gameplay experience, all from the perspective of a devoted working dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tale of friendship, bravery, and barking at sheep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.poster.avif?t=1772993823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.webm?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.mp4?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DOG</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Hubert, a fluffy and overconfident dog with a nose for trouble. He sees the world through movement, scent, instinct, and curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You experience the journey entirely from Hubert\u2019s perspective, as a devoted working dog learning his place in a quiet world that slowly proves less predictable than it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.poster.avif?t=1772993823\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.webm?t=1772993823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.mp4?t=